WEBVTT

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.066
In the dream,
were you standing next to the victim...

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:22.655
...or looking down at the scene?

00:00:23.114 --> 00:00:25.325
Neither. It was like I....

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:28.744
Will you please just tell me
what's happening?

00:00:28.793 --> 00:00:31.247
Everard, Arthur's on guard duty tonight.

00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:33.203
Make sure he's found
by the right people.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.704
- Sir.
- Phineas.

00:00:35.751 --> 00:00:38.045
You must go to your portrait
at Grimmauld Place.

00:00:38.212 --> 00:00:40.410
Tell them that Arthur Weasley
is gravely injured...

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:44.137
...and his children will be arriving there
soon by Portkey.

00:00:45.264 --> 00:00:46.342
They've got him, Albus.

00:00:46.429 --> 00:00:48.347
It was close,
but they think he'll make it.

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.641
What's more,
the Dark Lord failed to acquire it.

00:00:50.808 --> 00:00:52.018
Oh, thank goodness. Next we need to--

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:54.604
Look at me!

00:01:01.068 --> 00:01:02.459
What's happening to me?

00:01:11.162 --> 00:01:13.039
You wished to see me, headmaster?

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:17.526
Oh, Severus. I'm afraid we can't wait.
Not even till the morning.

00:01:18.502 --> 00:01:20.342
Otherwise, we'll all be vulnerable.

00:01:26.177 --> 00:01:27.803
It appears there's a connection...

00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:30.306
...between the Dark Lord's mind
and your own.

00:01:30.514 --> 00:01:34.644
Whether he is, as yet, aware of this
connection is, for the moment, unclear.

00:01:35.019 --> 00:01:37.441
Pray he remains ignorant.

00:01:38.468 --> 00:01:40.765
You mean, if he knows about it, then...

00:01:41.942 --> 00:01:45.082
-...he'll be able to read my mind?
-Read it, control it...

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.366
...unhinge it.

00:01:48.532 --> 00:01:51.911
In the past, it was often
the Dark Lord's pleasure...

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.330
...to invade the minds of his victims...

00:01:54.538 --> 00:01:58.084
...creating visions designed
to torture them into madness.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:04.006
Only after extracting the last exquisite
ounce of agony...

00:02:04.173 --> 00:02:07.999
...only when he had them literally
begging for death, would he finally...

00:02:08.636 --> 00:02:09.845
...kill them.

00:02:10.846 --> 00:02:13.265
Used properly,
the power of Occlumency...

00:02:13.432 --> 00:02:16.546
...will help shield you
from access or influence.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:21.857
In these lessons, I will attempt
to penetrate your mind.

00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:24.659
You will attempt to resist.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.279
Prepare yourself.

00:02:30.074 --> 00:02:31.242
Legilimens.

00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:42.962
Concentrate, Potter. Focus.

00:03:08.863 --> 00:03:10.489
Ho, ho, ho. Merry Christmas.

00:03:11.699 --> 00:03:13.888
Here we go.

00:03:14.535 --> 00:03:16.704
Daddy's back. Oh.

00:03:19.874 --> 00:03:23.502
Sit down, everybody, sit down.
That's it. Now, presents.

00:03:23.669 --> 00:03:28.048
- And a nice big box for Ron.
- Big box for you. And, um....

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:33.053
Fred and George. Come on, open up.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.514
- I want to see your faces.
- Yes.

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:38.100
- Try it on.
- Thanks, Mum. It's perfect.

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:42.563
-Just what he wanted, actually.
-Yeah. Right. Thanks, Mum.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:45.038
Come on, then, everybody.
Let's clear this away.

00:03:45.175 --> 00:03:47.437
Oh, Harry, Harry.

00:03:47.943 --> 00:03:49.862
There you are.

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.698
-Happy Christmas.
-Thank you.

00:03:53.282 --> 00:03:55.117
-Lovely to have you with us.
-Thank you.

00:03:55.284 --> 00:03:56.836
Now, Daddy. Pass that to Daddy.

00:03:57.453 --> 00:03:59.163
- Thank you.
- Has everybody got?

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:00.706
Fred? George?

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.657
- Hermione.
- A Christmas toast.

00:04:03.294 --> 00:04:04.571
To Mr. Harry Potter...

00:04:06.682 --> 00:04:08.908
...without whom I would not be here.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.891
- Harry.
- Harry.

00:04:15.307 --> 00:04:16.400
Harry.

00:04:17.681 --> 00:04:20.226
That is delicious.
I shall be needing some more of that.

00:04:20.392 --> 00:04:22.770
Daddy, don't forget last Christmas.

00:04:23.687 --> 00:04:25.880
I can't understand
why you don't want to wear it, Ronald.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.735
I look like a b***dy idiot, that's why.

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.737
No more than usual, Ron.

00:04:31.946 --> 00:04:33.781
I don't know why....

00:04:39.787 --> 00:04:43.255
Nasty brat, standing there
as bold as brass.

00:04:44.542 --> 00:04:48.886
Harry Potter,
the boy who stopped the Dark Lord.

00:04:49.463 --> 00:04:52.466
Friend of Mudbloods
and blood-traitors alike.

00:04:52.883 --> 00:04:55.511
- If my poor mistress only knew....
- Kreacher!

00:04:55.719 --> 00:04:58.514
That's enough of your bile.
Away with you!

00:04:58.942 --> 00:05:00.683
Of course, master.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:04.171
Kreacher lives to serve
the noble house of Black.

00:05:07.857 --> 00:05:09.163
Sorry about that.

00:05:10.317 --> 00:05:12.928
He never was very pleasant,
even when I was a boy.

00:05:14.321 --> 00:05:15.327
Not to me, anyway.

00:05:17.241 --> 00:05:18.631
What, you grew up here?

00:05:19.368 --> 00:05:20.720
This is my parents' house.

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.851
I offered it to Dumbledore
as headquarters for the Order.

00:05:26.917 --> 00:05:29.174
About the only useful thing
I've been able to do.

00:05:31.719 --> 00:05:33.416
This is the Black family tree.

00:05:34.884 --> 00:05:36.551
My deranged cousin.

00:05:37.177 --> 00:05:38.829
I hated the lot of them.

00:05:39.865 --> 00:05:44.178
My parents with their pure-blood mania.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.615
My mother did that after I ran away.

